Package: MST2sample
Type: Package
Title: Pruned Minimum Spanning Tree Two-Sample Tests
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Angshuman", "Roy", email = "angshuman_roy@iittp.ac.in",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The two-sample tests S, T, S_m, T_m and C_m based on the
    pooled Euclidean minimum spanning tree with the cross-sample edges
    removed. The distance matrix, the minimum spanning tree, the statistics
    over many relabelings, the exact permutation moments of the numbers of
    isolated vertices and the exact attained p-values of S and T are computed
    in C++.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: Rcpp, MASS, stats
LinkingTo: Rcpp
